<title>HONG KONG: Bangkok Bank sets US$150 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank sets US$150 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger and lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANGKOK BANK ACTING THROUGH ITS HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$150 MLN   COUPON    6ML+18.75BP MATURITY  7 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCHED  27.AUG.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 5	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES</p>
<p>10.SEPT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  A2/A-	  SALE LMTS THAI/HK/US NOT 144A</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME     THAILAND     GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE</p>
<p>25.SEPT.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     CO-LEAD MANAGERS US$5-7 MLN   26.25BP  ALL-IN 24BP</p>
<p>	     SENIOR MANAGERS  US$3-4 MLN   21.25BP  ALL-IN 23BP</p>
<p>ARRANGER AND LEAD MANAGER HSBC MARKETS</p>
<p>CO-ARRANGERS &amp; LEAD MGRS  IBJ ASIA, MERRILL LYNCH INTERNTIONAL,</p>
<p>				   JP MORGAN SECURITIES ASIA, SAKURA</p>
<p>				   FINANCE ASIA, TOKAI ASIA,</p>
<p>--HK Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
